      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know... but it's hard to choose a future when there's no one actually living it. it feels like i'm just performing the motions of a person. i wake up, i eat, i go to work, but there's just this massive hole where \"me\" used to be. it's like i'm waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever can because the person who was supposed to experience it is already dead. does that even make sense? it's just so empty.",
